{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deathplane is a 2D puzzle-platformer game about moving the actual deathplane below the level up and down to kill enemies and find solutions and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It has five worlds, each with varying amounts of levels; each level is a small, bite-sized challenge to be scrutinized to how you see fit. Rush through the game, or play around with it, explore and tinker around . . . you might just find something wonderful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play how and where you want! Almost everything is unlocked from the get-go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Platforming system designed to be fun to play from the ground up</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story (rarity for platformers nowadays)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller support</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Funny dialogue</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five worlds</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional collectibles for you to brag about</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Achievements for you to brag about as well </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3925420?t=1770070593","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925420/ad86d2c20182940f5d9d135432382ca41e6fd7af/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770070593","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925420/4f006ec3c72cb7554a709c5f101c380365e0fcc6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770070593","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925420/4f006ec3c72cb7554a709c5f101c380365e0fcc6